WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
One cylinder hides a measurable volume.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Bore sets area. Stroke sets travel.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Now count every cylinder.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Convert mm³ to cm³: divide by 1,000.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
If stroke grows, what changes?

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
This example is geometry, not power.

